bitcoin-core (31.1-1+dwdc1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Add benthecarman's -signetblocktime patch (Bitcoin Core PR #27446,
    closed unmerged; carried by Bitcoin Knots as d8434da3c1). Needed for
    btc.signet.dwdc.club to hold sixty-second blocks: Core's signet
    retargets toward its hardcoded ten-minute spacing otherwise.
  * Package is consequently no longer a zero-patch build of upstream.
    The description states the patch and its consequence.

